{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42101","headline":"冬日书怀寄惟真大师 · 李中","name":"冬日书怀寄惟真大师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自别吾师後，风骚道甚孤。\n雪霜侵鬓发，音信隔江湖。\n扰扰悲时世，悠悠役梦途。\n向公期尽节，多病怕倾壶。\n贱迹虽慙滞，幽情忍使辜。\n诗成天外句，棊覆夜中图。\n落壁灯花碎，飘窗雪片麤。\n煮茶烧栗兴，早晚复围炉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}